From ae9522cf42de348f3623a35add638e3dfbadadb7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Codex <codex@openai.com>
Date: Thu, 2 Apr 2026 11:29:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add Lost Souls system, MVP anti-KS/solo-lock and card-combo
 blacklist

### Motivation
- Introduce a Lost Souls mechanic to mark/recover characters that die in specified maps and block normal respawn during the recovery window.
- Prevent MVP kill stealing/camping by locking MVP damage ownership to the first attacker (party or solo) with inactivity and solo-kill cooldowns.
- Provide a server-side card combination blacklist to prevent undesirable card pairs from being inserted together into equipment.

### Description
- Lost Souls: add `lost_souls` table and `char` columns `soul_deadline` and `is_lost`, add SQL upgrade `upgrade_20260314_lost_souls.sql`, and export `MF_AINCRAD` script constant; add `npc/events/lost_souls.txt` script and enable it in `npc/scripts_athena.conf`.
- Character flow: block selection/login of characters with `is_lost`, set and clear `soul_deadline` timer on death in AINCRAD maps, add `pc_soul_deadline_timer` to trigger `LOST_SOULS::OnSoulLost`, and prevent `Restart` while a soul-revive window is pending.
- MVP lock system: add new config options in `conf/battle/drops.conf` and battle config fields (`mvp_lock_enable`, `mvp_lock_inactivity_timeout`, `mvp_solo_kill_limit`, `mvp_solo_cooldown`) and associated loading entries; implement MVP locking in mob logic (`mob.hpp/cpp`): determine player source, create/validate/clear locks, enforce damage allowance via `mob_mvp_damage_allowed`, track per-account solo kill lockouts and apply cooldowns after configured consecutive solo kills, and clear locks on revive/death/spawn.
- Loot/drop behavior: attach owner char position to delayed/looted drops so items drop at the owner location when applicable and store `owner_charid` in `s_item_drop` to assist placement/autoloot logic.
- Card combination blacklist: add import template and data files (`db/import-tmpl/card_combo_blacklist.txt`, `db/pre-re/card_combo_blacklist.txt`, `db/re/card_combo_blacklist.txt`), keep an in-memory `card_combo_blacklist` set, add parser `pc_readdb_card_combo_blacklist` and load it in `pc_readdb`, and enforce blacklist in `pc_insert_card` with a user-facing message.
- Misc: add two items in `db/import/item_db.yml` (Butterfly Wing and Ring Of Return); adjust emotion packet parsing to support new expansion packet mapping and route to `clif_parse_Emotion` via `clif_packetdb.hpp` changes.

### Testing
- Automated build: compiled the server codebase (map and char modules) with the changes applied, and the build completed successfully.
- Unit/regression tests: ran repository unit/regression tests (automated test suite) and all tests passed.
- Integration (automated): ran automated integration checks that exercise character selection, death/respawn behavior on AINCRAD maps, MVP damage flow, and card insertion paths; checks succeeded and the new behaviors (selection block for lost souls, restart block while pending, MVP locking, card blacklist rejection) were detected as expected.
